  "note": "Election of the Banbridge Urban Council, 1955; fifteen papers were lodged for the fifteen seats, all for sitting members, so there was no poll. All ten were sitting members. No party labels were printed. The paper adds that the next election would be held in May, 1958. Returned unopposed."
